      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would also be good for Udon scripts that use the player position for audio effects since audio can now be captured from the camera.\n\nI have an Udon script that delays sound played by distance to the player, and it would sound wrong if the audio listener were to be on the camera. The attached video also has an Udon script for playing the sound of projectiles going past the player's position.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
