  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-08-23T03:17:25.949Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "If I could get camera information using UDON, I would be able to make more gimmicks, but wouldn't it be possible to use UDON to get the location information of each user's or local VRC's camera, as well as the angle of view locally?\n\nI also think that even if a camera is inserted into an area that you don't want people to see (for example, inside a wall), you can deal with it if you can obtain information such as its location.\n\nPlease consider it if you like.\n\nI hope you read it to the end.\n\nI used Google Convert.",
